<view class="page mine-page">
  <view class="profile-card card"><view class="avatar">我</view><view class="profile-copy"><view class="profile-name">个人中心</view><view class="profile-status">本地模式</view></view></view>
  <view class="profile-hint">当前无需登录。账号与个人资料功能将在后续接入。</view>

  <view class="score-card card">
    <view class="score-heading"><view><view class="section-title">给工具箱打分</view><view class="section-subtitle">选择 1 至 10 分，记录你的使用感受</view></view><view class="current-score">{{savedScore === null ? '未评分' : savedScore + '分'}}</view></view>
    <view class="score-grid"><view wx:for="{{scoreOptions}}" wx:key="*this" class="score-option {{draftScore === item ? 'active' : ''}}" data-score="{{item}}" bindtap="chooseScore">{{item}}</view></view>
    <button class="save-score" bindtap="saveScore">保存评分</button>
    <view wx:if="{{savedAt}}" class="saved-time">上次保存：{{savedAt}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="links-card card"><view class="link-row" bindtap="openPrivacy"><text>隐私政策</text><text>›</text></view><view class="link-row" bindtap="openTerms"><text>用户服务协议</text><text>›</text></view></view>
  <view class="local-note">评分仅保存在当前设备，清理缓存或删除小程序可能导致记录丢失。</view>
</view>
